tomer satisfaction and cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/credicorp-ltd-bap-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BAP 2019 Q1","e":"bap","d":"2019-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Francesca Raffo","x":"We have seen relevant results in customer experiences, and we are now concentrating on gaining traction on digital sales and emphasizing initiatives that generate cost savings and new income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/credicorp-ltd-bap-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BAP 2019 Q1","e":"bap","d":"2019-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Cesar Rios","x":"At this point, we are maintaining the guidance as stated in page 21 adjusting only the reference rate as we mentioned previously.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/credicorp-ltd-bap-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BAP 2019 Q2","e":"bap","d":"2019-08-09","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Ernesto Gabilondo","x":"And in addition the political turmoil of celebrating presidential elections next year and the escalation of the global trade war.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/16/credicorp-ltd-bap-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BAP 2019 Q2","e":"bap","d":"2019-08-09","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Ernesto Gabilondo","x":"However, we think there could be likely some delays in some construction and large infrastructure projects and some impacts related to the uncertainty of the global trade war.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/16/credicorp-ltd-bap-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BAP 2019 Q2","e":"bap","d":"2019-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Cesar Rios","x":"As a specific digital success story, I would like to mention that our consumer loan digital monthly sales has doubled the disbursements in the quarter while achieving a fixed full cost reduction compared to the traditional branch channel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/16/credicorp-ltd-bap-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BAP 2019 Q3","e":"bap","d":"2019-11-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gianfranco Ferrari","x":"Basically raising price where prices were appropriate and/or managing risk adequately.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/08/credicorp-ltd-bap-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BAP 2019 Q3","e":"bap","d":"2019-11-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Cesar Rios Briceno","x":"As a general rule you can see that the combination of the duration of the portfolio and the pass-through effect means that more or less 1/3 of the top line increase or decrease in interest rate I translated in the bottom line to the period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/08/credicorp-ltd-bap-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BAP 2020 Q1","e":"bap","d":"2020-05-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Cesar Rios","x":"The reference rate is already at the minimum historical level at 0.25% and the interest rate has already been passed through in the new transactions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/credicorp-ltd-bap-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BAP 2020 Q1","e":"bap","d":"2020-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Cesar Rios","x":"Administrative expenses were down this quarter driven by the implementation of cost savings programs and some delays in executions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/credicorp-ltd-bap-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BAP 2020 Q1","e":"bap","d":"2020-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Cesar Rios","x":"In BCP, we are focusing on engaging with customers to understand their situation post COVID-19 on financial needs, implementing Reactiva Peru program, adjusting risk management measures and designin